{jñānadīkṣā} ||

avighnamastu 

[śivaṃ praṇamya paramaṃ nidhaneśamataḥ param |
jñānadīkṣāṃ pravakṣyā (**) śṛṇudhvaṃ samāhitāḥ] |

athātmamalamāyākhyakarmabandhavimuktaye |
vyakteye ca śivatvasya śivajñānaṃ pravartate ||

jñānaṃ dvividhamākhyātaṃ paraṃ cāparameva |
praṃ caivāvabodhākhyamaparaṃ śāstramuttamam ||

sṛṣṭikāle maheśānaḥ puruṣārtha prasiddhaye |
vi (**) vimalaṃ jñānaṃ pañcasrotobhilakṣitam ||

jñā (*****) kṣārthaṃ saṃgrahaṇātmabheṣajam |
pariṇāmasukhaṃ svādu viśeṣaguṇadarśakam ||

dharmeṇa sā (***) rmi kvacitkāryeṇakāraṇam | 
kāra (****) kāryaṃ kvacidāmnāya darśanāt ||

acetanasya māyādeḥ pravartakatayā patiḥ |
siddhassarvārtha (***) vyākassa tatoditaḥ ||

drakriyā (***) yasya taddātrapūrva (***) |
(***) ssotra mantavyaḥ śaktidvayayutaḥ prabhuḥ ||

<p. 2>

mataṅge(-)

trage (**) radhiṣṭhānaṃ svaśaktikiraṇātmakam |
ta (******) tmā niṣkaṃpo calamūrtimān ||

kāṣṭhā saiva parā sūkṣmā sarvadikkāmṛtātmikā |
pṛthvī (****) śāntā vastumātrātilālasā ||

ādyanto (*****) mūrtitvenopacaryate |
sthirāvanyonyaloke'smin saṃvidānopalabhyate ||

vapuṣo vidyamānatva (**) tkṛtyaṃ karoti saḥ |
tatra tatrāsya tatkartṛvapuṣā (*****) ||

kiraṇe(-) 

karaṇaṃ ca na śanyacchaktirnācetanācitaḥ |
viṣayāniyamādekaṃ bodhe kṛtye ca tattathā ||

yathā kālohyamūrto'pi dṛśyate phalasādhakaḥ |
(****) hyamūrto'pi kurute kāryamicchayā ||

śaktodyuktapravṛktaśca kartā trividha iṣyate |
śakteḥ pravṛttibhedena bhedastasyopacārataḥ ||

nimitta (*****) dyaddṛṣṭaṃ sahakāraṇam |
upādānañca yatsūkṣmaṃ sarvakārye tu saṃhitam ||

mūrtāssāvayavāyetthā nānārūpaparicchadaḥ |
sthūlāvayava (*****) madhye tu pūrvakāḥ ||

<p. 3>

ato'sti buddhimānkaścidīśvarassamavasthitaḥ |
jagajjanmasthitidhvaṃsatire bhāvavimuktaḥ ||

kṛtyaṃsakārakaphalaṃ jñeyamasyai (****) |
svāpepyāste bodhayanbodhayogyān (*****) ||

roddhyānrundhanpācayankarmikarma |
māyāśaktivyaktiyogyānprakurvan 
paśyansarva (*****) (*****) jātam 
||  

dehānyonīśvarovyāpī vibhinnassamalo jaḍaḥ |
svakarmaphalabhukkartā kiñcijñasseśvaraḥ paśuḥ ||

athānādimalaḥ puṃsāṃ paśutvaṃ parikīrtitam |
tuṣakukambukavajjñeyo māyābījāṅkurasya tat ||

(******) tānāṃ anādinibiḍaṃ mahat |
pratyātmasthasvakālāntāpāthaśaktisamūhavat ||

tāsāṃ māheśvarī śaktissarvānugrāhikā śivā |
dharmānuvartanādeva pāśadva (*****) ||

pariṇāmavatītāśca rodhāntaṃ kārkacatviṣā |
yadonmīlanamādatte tadānugrāhyakocyate ||

yathā kuṇḍalinī śaktirmāyākarmānu sāriṇi |
nādaba (****) ryaṃ tasyā iti jagatsthitiḥ ||

<p. 4>

tasyāścatasro vāgrūpā vṛttayo vai kharyādayaḥ |
vaikharī madhyamā cāntyapa'syantī sūkṣmasaṃjñikā ||

māyātatvaṃ jagadbījama (******) (**) |
vibhvekamakalaṃ sūkṣmamanādyavyayamīśvaram ||

tadekamaśivabījasthaṃ jagataścitraśaktimat |
sahakāryadhikārānta saṃrodhivyāpyanaśvaram ||

śuddhe dhvaniśi (****) kto nantosi te prabhuḥ |
grandhijanyakalākāla vidyārāganumātaraḥ ||

guṇādhī garva cintākṣamātrābhūtānyanukramāt |
dharmādharmātmakaṃ karma tacca trividhama (**) ||

(***) rbho gadaṃ yena nāmitraṃ paśyate kvacit |
karma vyāpārajanyatvādadṛṣṭaṃ sūkṣmabhāvataḥ ||

janakandhārakaṃ bhogyaṃ adhvātmāditrisādhanam |
tatsatyānutayonitvā (*****) rūpakam || 

svāpe vipākamabhyeti tatsraṣṭāpupayujyate |
māyāyāṃ vartate cānte nābhuktaṃ kṣaya (***) ||

athātmā vimalo baddhaḥ punarmuktaśca (***) |
(***) ssatridhāvasthaḥ kevalassakalo malaḥ ||

acetano vibhurnityo guṇahīno kriyo pra (*) |
(***) tabhāgaśaktaśca śodhyo bodhyo ka (**) ||

<p. 5>

caitanyaṃ dṛkkriyā (****) tyātmani sarvadā |
sarvataśca yato muktau śrūyate sarvatomu (*) ||

(***) dapya bhāsamānatvāttanniruddhaṃ (**) |
(***) vṛtavīryasya sonta evāvimokṣaṇāt ||

pāśābhāve parātantryaṃ vaktavyaṃ kinnabandhanam |
svābhāvikañcenmu (***) ktaśabdo nivartate ||

anādimalasaṃba (*****) rmayoditaḥ |
anādimalamuktatvātsarvajño'sau tataṃ śivaḥ ||

ādimatvaṃ yadā siddhannimittaṃ kalpate tadā |
ī (**) paṃ smṛtaṃ tābhyāṃ śuddhāśuddhaṃ yathārthataḥ ||

(*****) kaṃ kasmātsamātāmraṃ sakālikam |
yathā tatra nimittaṃ no tathā naiva śivātmanoḥ ||

prayoktrādimahīprāntametadaṇḍārtha sādhakam |
pratyātmaniyataṃ (*****) pyavasīyate ||

sarvato yugapanukteranutpādādasarvagam |
bhinnajātīyamapyekaphalaṃ dīpāṅgavastuvat ||

muktyarthaṃ sa paśurbaddho nānya (*****) te |
yāvaccharīrasaṃśleṣo na saṃjāto na bhogabhuk ||

atyantamalinasyāsya prāguktasyāvikāriṇaḥ |
kalā saṃśleṣamāyāti śivecchānuvi (***) ||

<p. 6>

karmaṇā dehasaṃyogo vibhorapi maheśvarāt |
aśaktatvātsvato nāsvasāmarthyaṃ karmayojane ||

paśutvaruddhacicchaktessvātantrya (*****) |
karmacidrahitantasmādyojakastadapekṣate ||

yojakassamaheśānassvecchayā balavānyataḥ |
vaikharī śrotraviṣayā sa vikalpā tu madhyamā ||

nirvi (*****) vā gāsāṃ kāraṇamantimā |
āśureva jagatsarvaṃ prabuddhaṃ śabdavṛttibhiḥ ||

na hi śabdādṛte puṃsaḥ pratyayo'sti kadācana |
śabdānuvṛddhameveha viśva (******) ||

etā eva parobandhaḥ paśūnāṃ paramārthataḥ |
kalotbalita caitanyo vidyādarśitatagocaraḥ ||

rāgeṇa rañjitaścāpi budhyādikaraṇe (**) |
māyādyavani paryante datvā bhūtātmavartmani ||

bhuṅkte tatra sthitānbhogān bhogaikarasikaḥ pumān |
bhogo'sya vedanā puṃsaḥ sukhaduḥkhātilakṣaṇaḥ ||

tāṃ (******) nyaḥ pumānabhyeti karmataḥ |
karmataśca śarīrāhi viṣayāḥ karaṇāni ca ||

bhogasaṃsiddhaye bhoktuṃrbhavanti na bhavanti ca |
evaṃ māyājanasthoṇurnijadoṣatira (**) ||

<p. 7>

